<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan one-month NCDs average yield at 5.827.</title>
<headline>Taiwan one-month NCDs average yield at 5.827.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank issued T$5 billion in 10-day negotiable certificates of deposit on Wednesday at an average yield of 5.827 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The range of the bids was between 5.800-5.873 percent.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$15.7 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
<p>($1 = T$27.66)</p>
</text>
